@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificar Saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Buscar Métricas
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar Faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar Fatura pelo Identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

###  Criar Fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "pending",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Alterar Fatura
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/184
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": 1,
    "amount": 125037,
    "status": "paid",
    "issueDate": "2026-10-01",
    "dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### Deletar Fatura
DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/184